# Task Detail

::summary
The task detail surface in the shell wrapper: circled back, action bar with icon-only Ask Surfy (fin glyph, `askSurfyTask` grounding seed) and Assign (G3) beside the labelled Mark as Done / Move-to-next primaries, the 8-stage stepper with live durations, the six-tile properties band, Time-in-Status and Token Cost stat bands (CSS-2026-002 + B-31), description, and the activity thread with composer. The Assign sheet is `modals/assign.surf` — no inline copy.
::

