## Stage stepper

| To Do | Research | Plan | Design | Breakdown | Build | Verify | Done |
|-------|----------|------|--------|-----------|-------|--------|------|
| ✓ 2d 4h | ● 3h 12m (live) | · | · | · | · | · | · |

Completed = accent-filled node with check; current = accent ring with soft halo, duration ticking live every second from the local clock (no polling); upcoming = muted. Horizontal scroll below ~640px. Advancing accumulates the elapsed delta into the stage being LEFT and restarts the new stage's counter at zero; accumulation ceases at Done.

